Does the loadstone really matter here?  As soon as it's in my inventory,
I usually have a very good idea what it is that I shouldn't have picked
up right now…  Or do you show the weight of stuff on the floor as well?

Compared to real life, the stone lying (double meaning) on the floor
will not seem very heavy, i.e. will seem to have the same weight as
other grey stones.  As soon as you try to pick it up and it clings to
your <hands>, you discover that it is actually made of Heavitium-512.
Conveniently, that's also the moment when it enters your inventory.

